      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "AI 应用要看 prompt chains、model decision paths、retrieval context、Token consumption，以及整个 reasoning workflow。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 10.91,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 10.56,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s02.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep05-production-readiness/audio/s02.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "多轮工具调用、检索结果、Agent 交接都会让上下文膨胀。上下文失控，Agent 的行为就会变得不可控。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 10.262,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 9.912,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s03.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep05-production-readiness/audio/s03.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "原文提到 context editing、memory tools、pagination、filtering、truncation 和 token caps。这些不是优化项，是上线条件。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 11.318,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 10.968,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s04.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep05-production-readiness/audio/s04.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "传统软件的错误路径通常可复现，但 Agent 的决策可能每次不同。生产系统必须记录、评估、限制和回滚。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.614,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.264,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s05.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep05-production-readiness/audio/s05.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "不要只看模型分数。要看节省时间、错误率、人工接管率、客户体验和成本，指标必须能说明业务价值。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.398,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.048,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s06.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep05-production-readiness/audio/s06.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "第一个门：任务边界清楚。第二个门：工具权限可控。第三个门：上下文可管理。第四个门：失败能被发现和接管。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 13.55,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 13.2,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s07.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep05-production-readiness/audio/s07.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "第五集的结论是：生产级 Agent 不是先追求更聪明，而是先做到可见、可控、可接管。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 9.11,
